“Subhūti, the form constituent is the dharma-constituent” I have not been able to identify the version of the Sūtra from which this and the following are extracted. Cf. ’bum na 100a2–3, khri brgyad
: “All dharmas are the dharma-constituent”; and Subhūti’s two hundred and fifteenth question (khri brgyad
), “How should bodhisattva great beings train in the perfection of wisdom?” and so on.

